This crate bundles the following third-party material:

- models/selfie_segmenter_square.onnx and models/selfie_segmenter_landscape.onnx:
  MediaPipe Selfie Segmenter (square 256x256 and landscape 256x144),
  Copyright Google LLC, created by Tingbo Hou, Siargey Pisarchyk and Karthik Raveendran,
  licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (full text in LICENSE-APACHE).
  Model card: https://storage.googleapis.com/mediapipe-assets/Model%20Card%20MediaPipe%20Selfie%20Segmentation.pdf
  The files are the unchanged ONNX conversions published by the ONNX Community
  (https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/mediapipe_selfie_segmentation and
  https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/mediapipe_selfie_segmentation_landscape),
  also under Apache-2.0. Origin, revisions and checksums: models/README.md.

ONNX Runtime (MIT, Microsoft) is not bundled; applications provide it at run time.
